_menu_item','',0),(51,1,'2021-06-01 19:57:48','2021-04-19 19:12:40','','Sports','','publish','closed','closed','','51','','','2021-06-01 19:57:48','2021-06-01 19:57:48','',63,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=51',3,'nav_menu_item','',0),(52,1,'2021-04-19 19:13:07','2021-04-19 19:13:07','','Events','','publish','closed','closed','','events','','','2021-05-17 18:40:27','2021-05-17 18:40:27','',0,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?page_id=52',0,'page','',0),(53,1,'2021-04-19 19:13:07','2021-04-19 19:13:07','','Events','','inherit','closed','closed','','52-revision-v1','','','2021-04-19 19:13:07','2021-04-19 19:13:07','',52,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=53',0,'revision','',0),(54,1,'2021-04-19 19:13:19','2021-04-19 19:13:19','','Contact Us','','publish','closed','closed','','contact-us','','','2021-05-26 15:23:30','2021-05-26 15:23:30','',0,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?page_id=54',0,'page','',0),(55,1,'2021-04-19 19:13:19','2021-04-19 19:13:19','','Community','','inherit','closed','closed','','54-revision-v1','','','2021-04-19 19:13:19','2021-04-19 19:13:19','',54,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=55',0,'revision','',0),(58,1,'2021-04-19 19:15:19','2021-04-19 19:15:19','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:quote -->\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p>Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like piña coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>...or something like this:</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:quote -->\r\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\r\n<p>The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href=\"http://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sports','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-revision-v1','','','2021-04-19 19:15:19','2021-04-19 19:15:19','',2,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=58',0,'revision','',0),(59,1,'2021-04-19 19:15:47','2021-04-19 19:15:47','','Media Inquiries','','publish','closed','closed','','media-inquiries','','','2021-05-17 18:50:10','2021-05-17 18:50:10','',0,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?page_id=59',0,'page','',0),(60,1,'2021-04-19 19:15:47','2021-04-19 19:15:47','','Contact Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','59-revision-v1','','','2021-04-19 19:15:47','2021-04-19 19:15:47','',59,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=60',0,'revision','',0),(61,1,'2021-04-19 19:16:31','2021-04-19 19:16:31','','Join Our Team','','publish','closed','closed','','join-our-team','','','2021-04-19 19:16:31','2021-04-19 19:16:31','',0,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?page_id=61',0,'page','',0),(62,1,'2021-04-19 19:16:31','2021-04-19 19:16:31','','Join Our Team','','inherit','closed','closed','','61-revision-v1','','','2021-04-19 19:16:31','2021-04-19 19:16:31','',61,'https://int-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=62',0,'revision','',0),(63,1,'2021-04-19 19:16:43','2021-04-19 19:16:43','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Our Products</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">SPORTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Home to Sportsnet, Canada\'s #1 sports media brand; the NHL, Toronto Blue Jays, Raptors, WWE, world class venues, productions and more. We believe that sport has the power to change the world and that we can all be United By Sport.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/sports\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Sports</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"850\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Sports\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">TV & STREAMING</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Reaching 76% of total Canadian TV audience. We offer viewers a variety of intensely-local, urban-oriented and culturally diverse content across Canada. Hosting award-winning dramas and comedies, as well as working in partnership with the world’s largest ad-supported video on demand streaming service, Tubi.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/television-and-streaming/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore TV &amp; Streaming</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"851\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Television &amp; Streaming\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">RADIO & PODCASTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Rogers started with radio! Our founder, Ted Rogers purchased CHFI in 1960. We have grown to become a leading media company that strives to provide the best in news and entertainment to Canadians and Canadian businesses. Coast to coast, broadcasting from 55 Radio Stations and 29+ Podcasts, we create commercial campaigns that open the doors to new and returning customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/radio-podcasts/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Radio & Podcasts</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"849\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Radio &amp; Podcasts\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">CREATIVE SOLUTIONS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">We love working with brands to deliver creative solutions that drive impressive results. We have a full-service creative agency capabilities. Our Rogers Creative Group represents 300+ creative professionals including art directors, writers, sound and motion designers, researchers, strategists and more.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/creative-solutions/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Creative Solutions</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"847\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Creative Solutions\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">TODAY\'S SHOPPING CHOICE</h2><p class=\"product-description\">TSC is a leading interactive, multi-channel, Canadian retailer, offering a vast assortment of exclusive products and top brands to its customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\" https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/todays-shopping-choice/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore TSC</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"852\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - TSC\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">OUT OF HOME</h2><p class=\"product-description\">More than 3,500 digital screens placed in a variety of high dwell time environments, maximising attention! Utilize an eclectic mix of locations to maximize your brand impact as Can