6-398d8981b6ab','','','2021-05-19 20:05:54','2021-05-19 20:05:54','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/whats-happening/41cedac3-32b4-459a-a4d6-398d8981b6ab/',0,'customize_changeset','',0),(362,7,'2021-05-19 20:30:33','2021-05-19 20:30:33','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Offering viewers a variety of intensely-local, urban-oriented and culturally diverse content across Canada. We host award-winning dramas and comedies, including the exclusive FX on Hulu originals. We have a distinct alternative to other conventional television stations and use our megaphone with influential brands. As well as working in partnership with the world’s largest ad-supported video on demand streaming service, Tubi.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','TELEVISION & STREAMING','','inherit','closed','closed','','33-revision-v1','','','2021-05-19 20:30:33','2021-05-19 20:30:33','',33,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=362',0,'revision','',0),(363,7,'2021-05-19 22:30:25','2021-05-19 22:30:25','The ultimate podcast for dog lovers, How 2 Dog is here to answer everything you’ve ever wanted to know about our four-legged friends. Each week host and world-renowned animal expert Sherri Davis (from Hudson &amp; Rex) draws on illuminating conversations with fellow experts and her own vast experience to get to the bottom of our listeners’ canine questions. Call our hotline to ask your question at 1-833-HOW-2-DOG.','How 2 Dog','','publish','closed','closed','','how-2-dog','','','2021-05-27 16:54:38','2021-05-27 16:54:38','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?post_type=rsm-radio&#038;p=363',0,'rsm-radio','',0),(364,7,'2021-05-19 22:29:57','2021-05-19 22:29:57','','FPN_How2Dog_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048','','inherit','open','closed','','fpn_how2dog_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048','','','2021-05-19 22:29:57','2021-05-19 22:29:57','',363,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/FPN_How2Dog_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(365,7,'2021-05-19 22:30:01','2021-05-19 22:30:01','','FPN_IslandCrimeS2_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048','','inherit','open','closed','','fpn_islandcrimes2_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048','','','2021-05-19 22:30:01','2021-05-19 22:30:01','',363,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/FPN_IslandCrimeS2_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(366,7,'2021-05-19 22:30:06','2021-05-19 22:30:06','','FPN_Keyart_TheHopeful_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048','','inherit','open','closed','','fpn_keyart_thehopeful_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048','','','2021-05-19 22:30:06','2021-05-19 22:30:06','',363,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/FPN_Keyart_TheHopeful_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(367,7,'2021-05-19 22:35:11','2021-05-19 22:35:11','Amir Omidvar left Iran during the revolutionary crisis in 1982. For twenty months after leaving his home, Amir did everything he could to cross the Atlantic ocean. While taking refuge in Spain, he made three failed attempts to enter the US; a fake passport in Heathrow, a Mexican jail, and a beating by customs officers in Milan — until a fourth and final attempt brought him to Canadian shores. Amir speaks to his daughter, Shayda, about why he decided to leave and how arriving in Canada has impacted his life and the life of his family.','The Hopeful','','publish','closed','closed','','the-hopeful','','','2021-05-27 17:03:32','2021-05-27 17:03:32','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?post_type=rsm-radio&#038;p=367',0,'rsm-radio','',0),(368,7,'2021-05-19 22:41:16','2021-05-19 22:41:16','Each season of Island Crime focuses on one crime story based on Vancouver Island. Season 1: ‘Where is Lisa?’ digs into the mystery of 21-year-old Lisa Marie Young’s disappearance. Season 2: ‘Gone Boys’ follows the mystery of men who have gone missing in recent years on Vancouver Island. Host Laura Palmer speaks with family members, community leaders, criminologists, coroners, psychologists and the RCMP to put together the stories of these missing men. Could a serial killer be preying on vulnerable men on Vancouver Island? ‘Island Crime: Gone Boys’ raises a discussion about the challenges facing men who are isolated and marginalized due to brain injury, trauma, mental illness, or disability. Could the ‘us versus them’ attitude of the public on the island be creating easy victims whose disappearances go unnoticed by many?','Island Crime','','publish','closed','closed','','island-crime','','','2021-05-27 16:54:48','2021-05-27 16:54:48','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?post_type=rsm-radio&#038;p=368',0,'rsm-radio','',0),(369,7,'2021-05-19 22:38:32','2021-05-19 22:38:32','','FPN_BiggsBarr_1400x1400','','inherit','open','closed','','fpn_biggsbarr_1400x1400','','','2021-05-19 22:38:32','2021-05-19 22:38:32','',368,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/FPN_BiggsBarr_1400x1400.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(370,7,'2021-05-19 22:38:36','2021-05-19 22:38:36','','FPN_CanadianPolitics_Keyart_3000x3000-2048x2048','','inherit','open','closed','','fpn_canadianpolitics_keyart_3000x3000-2048x2048','','','2021-05-19 22:38:36','2021-05-19 22:38:36','',368,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/FPN_CanadianPolitics_Keyart_3000x3000-2048x2048-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(371,7,'2021-05-19 22:38:40','2021-05-19 22:38:40','','FPN_Heaven_Bent_3000x3000_2-2048x2048','','inherit','open','closed','','fpn_heaven_bent_3000x3000_2-2048x2048','','','2021-05-19 22:38:40','2021-05-19 22:38:40','',368,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/FPN_Heaven_Bent_3000x3000_2-2048x2048-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(372,7,'2021-05-19 22:38:45','2021-05-19 22:38:45','','FPN_How2Dog_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048','','inherit','open','closed','','fpn_how2dog_3000x3000_v2-2048x2048-2','','','2021-05-19 22:38:45','2021-05-19 22:38:45',