 an offer to buy, or an endorsement, recommendation, or sponsorship of any entity or security by Rogers or its affiliates; and (c) not necessarily reflective of the views or policies of Rogers and its affiliates, licensors and related companies, and each of their respective directors, officers, employees, consultants and agents. The Professional Information on the Rogers Media Sites is not guaranteed and no representations or warranties can be made as to the accuracy or completeness of the information provided as part of the Rogers Media Sites. <strong>We try to ensure that the information posted on the Rogers Media Sites is correct and up-to-date. We reserve the right to change or make corrections to any of the information provided on the Rogers Media Sites at any time and without any prior warning.</strong> The Professional Information provided should not be interpreted as professional advice and does not replace the opinion of a qualified professional. You expressly agree that your use of, or reliance on, any Professional Information is at your sole risk. You further agree that Rogers and its affiliates will not be responsible or liable, directly or indirectly, in any way for any loss or damage of any kind incurred as a result of, or in connection with your use of, or reliance on, any Professional Information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>18. <strong>THIRD PARTY MERCHANDISE AND/OR PRODUCTS</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>THIRD PARTY MERCHANDISE AND/OR PRODUCTS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol><li>We may receive a commission, fee, and/or other compensation on some purchases made on, through, or linked from a Rogers Media Site or Service.</li><li>Images available on or through a Rogers Media Site or Service, including without limitation Content, of third-party merchandise and/or products, may not accurately capture the actual appearance,