-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">SPORTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Home to Sportsnet, Canada\'s #1 sports media brand; the NHL, Toronto Blue Jays, Raptors, WWE, world class venues, productions and more. We believe that sport has the power to change the world and that we can all be United By Sport.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/sports\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Sports</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"505\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-e1622057450383-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-e1622057450383-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-e1622057450383-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-e1622057450383-80x121.jpg 80w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"Reimagine the future\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">TELEVISION & STREAMING</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Reaching 76% of total Canadian TV audience. We offer viewers a variety of intensely-local, urban-oriented and culturally diverse content across Canada. Hosting award-winning dramas and comedies, as well as working in partnership with the world’s largest ad-supported video on demand streaming service, Tubi.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/television-and-streaming/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Television &amp; Streaming</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"500\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/amlt-s3-2-phone-portrait-475x720.png\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/amlt-s3-2-phone-portrait-475x720.png 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/amlt-s3-2-phone-portrait-320x485.png 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/amlt-s3-2-phone-portrait-80x121.png 80w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">RADIO & PODCASTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Rogers started with radio! Our founder, Ted Rogers purchased CHFI in 1960. We have grown to become a leading media company that strives to provide the best in news and entertainment to Canadians and Canadian businesses. Coast to coast, broadcasting from 55 Radio Stations and 29+ Podcasts, we create commercial campaigns that open the doors to new and returning customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/radio-podcasts/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Radio &amp; Podcasts</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"505\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg 475w, https://