 attention! Utilize an eclectic mix of locations to maximize your brand impact as Canada re-opens</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/out-of-home/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Out Of Home</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"726\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Out Of Home\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">ADVANCED ADVERTISING</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Advanced Advertising is all about leveraging data to develop the next generation of ad experiences. We are moving toward a fully addressable ad ecosystem, which will allow marketers to more seamlessly reach consumers across devices and connect their campaigns to real business outcomes.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/advance-advertising/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Advanced Advertising</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"505\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-80x121.jpg 80w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"Reimagine the future\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->','WHAT WE DO','','inherit','closed','closed','','63-revision-v1','','','2021-05-27 20:29:06','2021-05-27 20:29:06','',63,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=728',0,'revision','',0),(729,7,'2021-05-27 20:51:01','2021-05-27 20:51:01','Citytv is home to Breakfast Television and Citynews which both recently won Canadian Screen Awards for “Best Morning Show” and “Best Local Newscast”!','Award winning content! ','','publish','closed','closed','','award-winning-citytv-app','','','2021-05-31 22:22:58','2021-05-31 22:22:58','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?post_type=rsm_highlight&#038;p=729',0,'rsm_highlight','',0),(730,7,'2021-05-27 20:51:01','2021-05-27 20:51:01','CityTv has seven television stations across Canada plus the award-winning Citytv Video app. Delivering influential brands such as Cityline, CityNews, and Breakfast Television.','Award Winning CityTv App','','inherit','closed','closed','','729-revision-v1','','','2021-05-27 20:51:01','2021-05-27 20:51:01','',729,'https://preprod-www