ng 70% of Canadians who watch videos online.','22 million Canadians watch videos every month','','inherit','closed','closed','','202-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 13:19:34','2021-05-31 13:19:34','',202,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=808',0,'revision','',0),(809,7,'2021-05-31 13:32:17','2021-05-31 13:32:17','Understand consumers at the device level with the combination of location based mobile data expertise and high dwell times.','Understand consumers at the device level','','inherit','closed','closed','','227-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 13:32:17','2021-05-31 13:32:17','',227,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=809',0,'revision','',0),(810,7,'2021-05-31 13:32:32','2021-05-31 13:32:32','Amplify your other media channels by more than 80% by including out-of-home.\r\n\r\n(source COMMB – “OOH Amplifies Other Media”, 2016)','Amplify your other media channels','','inherit','closed','closed','','225-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 13:32:32','2021-05-31 13:32:32','',225,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=810',0,'revision','',0),(811,7,'2021-05-31 13:32:56','2021-05-31 13:32:56','Amplify your other media channels by more than 80% by including out-of-home.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Amplify your other media channels','','inherit','closed','closed','','225-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 13:32:56','2021-05-31 13:32:56','',225,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=811',0,'revision','',0),(812,7,'2021-05-31 13:33:14','2021-05-31 13:33:14','We are passionate about helping clients and partners deliver breakthrough, innovative creative through the 50,000+ digital, social and broadcast pieces of creative we deliver each year!','Deliver breakthrough, innovative creative through the 50,000+ digital, social and broadcast pieces!','','inherit','closed','closed','','221-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 13:33:14','2021-05-31 13:33:14','',221,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=812',0,'revision','',0),(813,7,'2021-05-31 13:34:02','2021-05-31 13:34:02','The RSM Digital Radio network reaches 4.8 million Canadians every month, making the RSM network the 2nd largest ad-supported streaming audio network in Canada.','RSM Digital Radio network reaches 4.8M Canadians a month','','inherit','closed','closed','','209-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 13:34:02','2021-05-31 13:34:02','',209,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=813',0,'revision','',0),(815,3,'2021-05-31 14:34:11','2021-05-31 14:34:11','<!-- wp:heading -->\r\n<h2>Our Products</h2>\r\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">SPORTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Home to Sportsnet, Canada\'s #1 sports media brand; the NHL, Toronto Blue Jays, Raptors, WWE, world class venues, productions and more. We believe that sport has the power to change the world and that we can all be United By Sport.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/sports\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Sports</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"715\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"what-we-do-sports\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">TELEVISION & STREAMING</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Reaching 76% of total Canadian TV audience. We offer viewers a variety of intensely-local, urban-oriented and culturally diverse content across Canada. Hosting award-winning dramas and comedies, as well as working in partnership with the world’s largest ad-supported video on demand streaming service, Tubi.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/television-and-streaming/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Television & Streaming</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"716\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Television &amp; Streaming\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">RADIO & PODCASTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Rogers started with radio! Our founder, Ted Rogers purchased CHFI in 1960. We have grown to become a leading media company that strives to provide the best in news and entertainment to Canadians and Canadian businesses. Coast to coast, broadcasting from 55 Radio Stations and 29+ Podcasts, we create commercial campaigns that open the doors to new and returning customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/radio-podcasts/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Radio & Podcasts</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"718\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Radio &amp; Podcasts\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">CREATIVE SOLUTIONS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">We love working with brands to deliver creative solutions that drive impressive results. We have a full-service creative agency capabilities. Our Rogers Creative Group represents 300+ creative professionals including art directors, writers, sound and motion designers, researchers, strategists and more.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/creative-solutions/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Creative Solutions</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"719\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Creative Solutions\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 co