ard-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Out Of Home</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"726\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Out Of Home\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">ADVANCED ADVERTISING</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Advanced Advertising is all about leveraging data to develop the next generation of ad experiences. We are moving toward a fully addressable ad ecosystem, which will allow marketers to more seamlessly reach consumers across devices and connect their campaigns to real business outcomes.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/advance-advertising/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Advanced Advertising</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"505\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-80x121.jpg 80w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"Reimagine the future\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->','What we do','','inherit','closed','closed','','63-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 14:34:11','2021-05-31 14:34:11','',63,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=815',0,'revision','',0),(816,7,'2021-05-31 14:41:20','2021-05-31 14:41:20','More than 6,000 faces placed in a variety of high dwell time environments, maximizing attention! Utilize an eclectic mix of locations to maximize your brand impact as Canada re-opens.','OUT OF HOME','','inherit','closed','closed','','41-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 14:41:20','2021-05-31 14:41:20','',41,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=816',0,'revision','',0),(817,7,'2021-05-31 14:44:14','2021-05-31 14:44:14','<strong>May 29, 2021</strong> – As the quest to hoist Lord Stanley’s Cup continues, Sportsnet is bringing Canada’s hockey fans rinkside with exclusive English-language national coverage of second round action of the <strong><em>2021 Stanley Cup Playoffs</em></strong><em>.</em>\r\n\r\nServing up every game from every series in Round 2, Sportsnet’s post-season broadcasts continue on <strong>Sportsnet, Sportsnet 360, Sportsnet ONE, CBC</strong> and <strong>OMNI</strong> and via stream on <a href=\"http://www.snnow.ca/\"><strong>SN NOW</strong></a> and <a href=\"http://www.nhllive.com/\"><strong>NHL Live</strong></a>. Plus, Round 1 action between the Toronto Maple Leafs and Montreal Canadiens concludes with Game 7 on <strong>Monday, May 31</strong> at <strong>7 p.m. ET / 4 p.m. PT</strong> on Sportsnet, CBC and SN NOW.\r\n\r\nIn addition to television and streaming content, Canadians can catch live radio coverage of select North Division games across the <a href=\"http://www.sportsnet.ca/listen/\">Sportsnet Radio Network</a> (full schedule online). Fans can also stay up-to-date with the latest news, headlines and highlights – plus one-of-a-kind original content – on <a href=\"http://www.sportsnet.ca/\">sportsnet.ca</a>, the <a href=\"https://www.sportsnet.ca/sn-apps/\">Sportsnet App</a> and across Sportsnet’s <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVhibwHk4WKw4leUt6JfRLg\">YouTube</a>, <a href=\"https://instagram.com/sportsnet/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/sportsnet\">Twitter</a> and <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/Sportsnet\">Facebook</a> channels.\r\n\r\nIn addition to nightly Stanley Cup Playoffs action, Sportsnet will deliver live coverage of the <strong><em>2021 Draft Lottery</em></strong> on <strong>Wednesday, June 2 </strong>at <strong>7 p.m. ET / 4 p.m. PT </strong>on <strong>Sportsnet </strong>&amp; <strong>SN NOW</strong>.\r\n\r\n<strong><u>Broadcast Schedule and Game Crews</u></strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>\r\n</strong><strong>NORTH DIVISION – </strong><strong>If Toronto Maple Leafs Win Round 1 Series</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Toronto Maple Leafs vs. Winnipeg Jets</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Play-by-play: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/CCpxpSN\">Chris Cuthbert</a>; Game Analyst: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hnicsimmer\">Craig Simpson</a>; Reporters: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ScottOake\">Scott Oake</a> (WPG) &amp; <a href=\"https://twitter.com/SNkylebukauskas\">Kyle Bukauskas</a> (TOR)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table width=\"642\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G1</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Wed., June 2</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Winnipeg @ Toronto, 7:30 p.m. ET / 4:30 p.m. PT</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">SN &amp; CBC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G2</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Fri., June 4</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Winnipeg @ Toronto, 7:30 p.m. ET / 4:30 p.m. PT</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">SN &amp; CBC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G3</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Sun., June 6</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Toronto @ Winnipeg, 6 p.m. ET / 3 p.m. PT</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">SN</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G4</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Mon., June 7</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Toronto @ Winnipeg, TBD</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">SN &amp; CBC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G5*</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Wed., June 9</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Winnipeg @ Toronto, TBD</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">TBD</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G6*</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Fri., June 11</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Toronto @ Winnipeg, TBD</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">TBD</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G7*</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Sun., June 13</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Winnipeg @ Toronto, TBD</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">TBD</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<strong> </strong>\r\n\r\n<strong> </strong><strong>NORTH DIVISION – </strong><strong>If Montreal Canadiens Win Round 1 Series</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Montreal Canadiens vs. Winnipeg Jets</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Play-by-play: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/CCpxpSN\">Chris Cuthbert</a>; Game Analyst: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hnicsimmer\">Craig Simpson</a>; Reporters: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ScottOake\">Scott Oake</a> (WPG) &amp; <a href=\"https://twitter.com/SNkylebukauskas\">Kyle Bukauskas</a> (MTL)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table width=\"642\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G1</td>\r\n<td width=\"123\">Wed., June 2</td>\r\n<td width=\"378\">Montreal @ Winnipeg, 7:30 p.m. ET / 4:30 p.m. PT</td>\r\n<td width=\"96\">SN &amp; CBC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"45\">G2</td>\r\n<td w