riented and culturally diverse content across Canada. Hosting award-winning dramas and comedies, as well as working in partnership with the world’s largest ad-supported video on demand streaming service, Tubi.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/television-and-streaming/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Television & Streaming</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"716\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-television-and-streaming-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Television &amp; Streaming\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">RADIO & PODCASTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Rogers started with radio! Our founder, Ted Rogers purchased CHFI in 1960. We have grown to become a leading media company that strives to provide the best in news and entertainment to Canadians and Canadian businesses. Coast to coast, broadcasting from 55 Radio Stations and 29+ Podcasts, we create commercial campaigns that open the doors to new and returning customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/radio-podcasts/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Radio & Podcasts</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"718\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Radio &amp; Podcasts\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">CREATIVE SOLUTIONS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">We love working with brands to deliver creative solutions that drive impressive results. We have a full-service creative agency capabilities. Our Rogers Creative Group represents 300+ creative professionals including art directors, writers, sound and motion designers, researchers, strategists and more.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/creative-solutions/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Creative Solutions</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"719\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Creative Solutions\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">TODAY\'S SHOPPING CHOICE</h2><p class=\"product-description\">TSC is a leading interactive, multi-channel, Canadian retailer, offering a vast assortment of exclusive products and top brands to its customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\" https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/todays-shopping-choice/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore TSC</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"720\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-475x720-1-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-475x720-1-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-475x720-1-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-475x720-1-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-475x720-1-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-475x720-1.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - TSC\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">OUT OF HOME</h2><p class=\"product-description\">More than 3,500 digital screens placed in a variety of high dwell time environments, maximising attention! Utilize an eclectic mix of locations to maximize your brand impact as Canada re-opens</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/out-of-home/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Out Of Home</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"726\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh-475x720@2x.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Out Of Home\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\r\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">ADVANCED ADVERTISING</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Advanced Advertising is all about leveraging data to develop the next generation of ad experiences. We are moving toward a fully addressable ad ecosystem, which will allow marketers to more seamlessly reach consumers across devices and connect their campaigns to real business outcomes.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/advance-advertising/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Advanced Advertising</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"505\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/default-background-80x121.jpg 80w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"Reimagine the future\"/></div></div>\r\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->','What We Do','','inherit','closed','closed','','63-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 15:31:18','2021-05-31 15:31:18','',63,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=821',0,'revision','',0),(822,3,'2021-05-31 15:46:36','2021-05-31 15:46:36','#1 with traffic, weather, news, and sports. CityNews is everywhere. Ottawa\'s main destination for the latest local news, features on community leaders and events, business openings and everything in between. <a href=\"https://ottawa.citynews.ca/\">www.ottawa.citynews.ca</a>','101.1 FM CITYNEWS','','inherit','closed','closed','','703-autosave-v1','','','2021-05-31 15:46:36','2021-05-31 15:46:36','',703,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=822',0,'revision','',0),(823,7,'2021-05-31 16:03:28','2021-05-31 16:03:28','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>We\'re reimagining the future of sports and media. Our impressive collection of assets includes media properties, sports teams, sports events and productions, venues, e-commerce platforms and a close connection with the Rogers Connected Home and Wireless Teams. Collectively, we connect with 30 million Canadians every month.</p>\r\n<p>Rogers Sports &amp; Media is a diverse sports and content company. Our multimedia offerings include 54 radio stations, 29 local TV stations, 23 conventional and specialty television stations, podcasts, digital and e-commerce websites, and sporting events.  We deliver unique storytelling through our range of powerful brands which include: Citytv, TSC, Citynews, KiSS, Breakfast Television, Cityline, Sportsnet – Canada’s #1 media brand, the Blue Jays – Canada’s only Major League Baseball team, and more.  Rogers Sports &amp; Media is a subsidiary of Rogers Communications Inc.</p>\r\n<h2> </h2>\r\n<h2><strong>All IN for Equity</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Differences unite us all. That\'s why we\'re <a href=\"https://www.allinforequity.ca/\">All IN</a> for a world where equity matters. We\'re giving away a minimum of $10 million dollars in free advertising and creative services over the next five years to help small businesses, charities and organizations that support equity-seeking communities.</p>\r\n<p>We are deeply committed to inclusion and diversity, and we have a long track record of leading in this important space. Our all-encompassing and action-focused inclusion and diversity strategy called <a href=\"https://www.allinforequity.ca/\">All IN</a> is a wide-ranging initiative to support equity-seeking communities, amplify their stories, and drive positive change. We are proud to use our multi-platform megaphone to ensure diverse voices are heard.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Who We Are','','inherit','closed','closed','','1-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 16:03:28','2021-05-31 16:03:28','',1,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=823',0,'revision','',0),(824,7,'2021-05-31 16:05:28','2021-05-31 16:05:28','Our sports portfolio includes a broad mix of assets that are second to none. Home of Sportsnet, Canada\'s #1 sports media brand, the NHL, the Toronto Blue Jays, Raptors, WWE, world class venues, productions and more. We believe that sport has the power to change the world and that we can all be United By Sport.','SPORTS','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 16:05:28','2021-05-31 16:05:28','',2,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=824',0,'revision','',0),(825,3,'2021-05-31 16:06:16','2021-05-31 16:06:16','What We Do - About Television And Streaming','logos-television-and-streaming','What We Do - About Television And Streaming','inherit','open','closed','','logos-television-and-streaming','','','2021-05-31 16:07:35','2021-05-31 16:07:35','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/logos-television-and-streaming.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(826,3,'2021-05-31 16:06:37','2021-05-31 16:06:37','What We Do - About Sports','logos-sports','What We Do - About Sports','inherit','open','closed','','logos-sports','','','2021-05-31 16:07:50','2021-05-31 16:07:50','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/logos-sports.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(829,7,'2021-05-31 16:13:24','2021-05-31 16:13:24','Audiences across the Citytv network are up +14% for Ind. 2+ and +11% for A25-54 YoY so far in 2021!','Citytv audiences are up!','','inherit','closed','closed','','202-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 16:13:24','2021-05-31 16:13:24','',202,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=829',0,'revision','',0),(830,7,'2021-05-31 16:14:07','2021-05-31 16:14:07','Citytv is home to Breakfast Television and Citynews which both recently won Canadian Screen Awards for “Best Morning Show” and “Best Local Newscast”!','Award winning content! ','','inherit','closed','closed','','729-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 16:14:07','2021-05-31 16:14:07','',729,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=830',0,'revision','',0),(831,7,'2021-05-31 16:17:12','2021-05-31 16:17:12','Over the past two years, Canadians have embraced streaming in unprecedented numbers.\n\nWhile ‘traditional’ television is still a significant method of consumption, long-form video content streamed through\na connected device is a regular part of Canadian viewing patterns. In some cases, viewing through a connected device is the only way Canadians are consuming content.\n\nNow, as we enter what appears to be the final phase of the COVID-19 pandemic, this report – prepared by Rogers Sports &amp; Media and Tubi – takes a look at the state of Streaming in Canada: What streaming content are Canadians consuming, and how these changes affect advertisers, agencies, content creators and distributors, as they look to forge ahead in a post-COVID landscape?\n\nFind out more! <a href=\"https://www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Full-Stream-Ahead-Report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the Full Stream Ahead Report Now</a>.\n\n&nbsp;','Full Stream Ahead: An In-Depth Look At The Rise Of Streaming In Canada','','inherit','closed','closed','','662-autosave-v1','','','2021-05-31 16:17:12','2021-05-31 16:17:12','',662,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=831',0,'revision','',0),(832,7,'2021-05-31 16:19:06','2021-05-31 16:19:06','Full stream ahead','29093421-3223-46f8-ae1f-728ba9e7d456','Full stream ahead','inherit','open','closed','','29093421-3223-46f8-ae1f-728ba9e7d456','','','2021-05-31 16:19:16','2021-05-31 16:19:16','',662,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/29093421-3223-46f8-ae1f-728ba9e7d456.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `rsm_wp_posts` VALUES (833,7,'2021-05-31 16:19:41','2021-05-31 16:19:41','Over the past two years, Canadians have embraced streaming in unprecedented numbers.\r\n\r\nWhile ‘traditional’ television is still a significant method of consumption, long-form video content streamed through\r\na connected device is a regular part of Canadian viewing patterns. In some cases, viewing through a connected device is the only way Canadians are consuming content.\r\n\r\nNow, as we enter what appears to be the final phase of the COVID-19 pandemic, this report – prepared by Rogers Sports &amp; Media and Tubi – takes a look at the state of Streaming in Canada: What streaming content are Canadians consuming, and how these changes affect advertisers, agencies, content creators and distributors, as they look to forge ahead in a post-COVID landscape?\r\n\r\nFind out more! <a href=\"https://www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Full-Stream-Ahead-Report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the Full Stream Ahead Report Now</a>.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;','Full Stream Ahead: An In-Depth Look At The Rise Of Streaming In Canada','','inherit','closed','closed','','662-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 16:19:41','2021-05-31 16:19:41','',662,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=833',0,'revision','',0),(835,7,'2021-05-31 17:13:19','2021-05-31 17:13:19','We produce award-winning podcasts including: The Big Story (2019 Canadian Podcast Award Winner), Gravy Train (2020 Canadian Podcast Award Winner) and The Hopeful (Apple Podcast of the Year 2020). We also create podcasts for brands through Pacific Content, which was acquired by RSM in 2019.','Award-winning podcasts','','inherit','closed','closed','','207-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 17:13:19','2021-05-31 17:13:19','',207,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=835',0,'revision','',0),(836,3,'2021-05-31 17:14:13','2021-05-31 17:14:13','Offering viewers a variety of intensely-local, urban-oriented and culturally diverse content across Canada. We host award-winning dramas and comedies, including the exclusive FX on Hulu originals. We have a distinct alternative to other conventional television stations and use our megaphone with influential brands. As well as working in partnership with the world’s largest ad-supported video on demand streaming service, Tubi.','TELEVISION & STREAMING','','inherit','closed','closed','','33-autosave-v1','','','2021-05-31 17:14:13','2021-05-31 17:14:13','',33,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=836',0,'revision','',0),(837,7,'2021-05-31 17:14:48','2021-05-31 17:14:48','The Rogers Sports &amp; Media (RSM) Digital Audio network reaches 4.8 million Canadians every month, making the RSM network the 2nd largest ad-supported streaming audio network in Canada.','Our Digital Audio Network Reaches Almost 5 Million Canadians Per Month','','inherit','closed','closed','','209-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 17:14:48','2021-05-31 17:14:48','',209,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=837',0,'revision','',0),(838,7,'2021-05-31 17:23:42','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','open','open','','','','','2021-05-31 17:23:42','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=838',0,'post','',0),(839,7,'2021-04-20 17:23:42','2021-04-20 17:23:42','<i>Innovative Publishing and Brand-Safe Sponsorship Solutions Empower Podcast Publishers to Meet Fast Growing Market Demand</i>\r\n\r\nPress Release from <a href=\"https://www.adswizz.com/1b-monthly-podcast-downloads\">AdsWizz</a>, a partner of Rogers Sports &amp; Media.\r\n\r\n<b>San Mateo, CA  April 16, 2021 — </b>AdsWizz, the global leader in digital audio and podcast technology solutions, has reached the milestone of over 1 billion monthly downloads from its audio platform. The platform, which is used by leading media companies and podcast publishers including NPR, The New York Times, NBCUniversal News Group, American Public Media, Stitcher, PodcastOne, WNYC Studios, and Rogers Sports &amp; Media in Canada, combines publishing tools and audience analytics from its Simplecast product with its award-winning suite of monetization products and services.\r\n\r\nThe company’s tech powers the four most-listened-to podcasts in the US: The Daily from The New York Times; NPR News Now from NPR; Up First from NPR; and Dateline NBC from NBCUniversal News Group. The platform also powers successful shows from Dax Shepard (Armchair Umbrella network), Kate Hudson (Sibling Revelry), and Anna Faris (Unqualified).\r\n\r\nAdsWizz offers a full suite of monetization options for enterprise podcasters. They can utilize AdsWizz campaign management platform, AdsWizz AudioServe for their direct sales teams;  they can place their podcasts into AdsWizz Podcast Marketplace (PodWave);  or they can tap into the power and breadth of the sales teams of Pandora, Stitcher, and others to monetize their podcasts.  SiriusXM acquired Stitcher and Simplecast last year.  AdsWizz is wholly owned by SiriusXM and operates independently;  Simplecast operations are now a part of AdsWizz.\r\n\r\nAdsWizz innovation includes the proprietary AdsWizz PodScribe Contextual Targeting Solution, introduced over two years ago, which delivers brand safety and brand suitability for podcast advertisers. AdsWizz meets the needs of today’s podcast publishers with industry standard capabilities including, dynamic host read ads, targeting by genre and show, and ad-free feeds for premium publishers. The platform also has advanced programmatic capabilities and allows for the automation of host read ads, enabling podcast publishers to grow and scale as the podcast industry explodes. AdsWizz innovation in digital audio and podcasting was recently recognized when it was awarded “Most Innovative Technology Platform” by Digiday in January of 2021.\r\n\r\n“Podcast publishers need solutions that meet the needs of today’s growing podcast market, as well as more sophisticated capabilities that can adjust to the changing complexities and growing demand of the future,” said Alexis van de Wyer, CEO of AdsWizz.  “We have made a strong commitment to help publishers stay one step ahead of the market, and provide innovative technology so they have one less thing to worry about.”\r\n\r\nSimplecast, which is now part of the AdsWizz podcast offering, is the premier stand-alone publishing and analytics solution for new and growing independent podcasters, and is expected to offer integrated monetization tools for those publishers later this year. Simplecast was recently rated as “<a href=\"https://www.sonics.io/best-podcast-hosting\">The Best Podcast Hosting Service</a>” by Sonics Podcasts in March of 2021.\r\n\r\n<b>About AdsWizz</b>\r\n\r\nAdsWizz has created the end-to-end technology platform that is powering the digital audio advertising and podcast ecosystem. AdsWizz is the underlying monetization solution for well-known music platforms, podcasts and broadcasting groups worldwide. Through dynamic ad insertion, advanced programmatic platforms, and innovative audio formats, AdsWizz efficiently connects buyers and sellers for digital audio and podcast advertising, and offers industry leading podcast publishing and analytics via Simplecast. AdsWizz is owned by SiriusXM, and is headquartered in San Mateo, California, with a Technology Development Hub in Bucharest, Romania.\r\n\r\n<strong>About Rogers Sports &amp; Media</strong>\r\nRogers Sports &amp; Media is a diverse sports and content company that connects with more than 30 million Canadians each week.  The company’s multimedia offerings include 54 radio stations, 29 local TV stations, 23 conventional and specialty television stations, podcasts, digital and e-commerce websites, and sporting events.  Rogers Sports &amp; Media delivers unique storytelling through its range of powerful brands: Citytv, OMNI Television, FX, TSC, 680 NEWS, 98.1 CHFI, KiSS, Breakfast Television, Cityline, CityNews, Sportsnet – Canada’s #1 sports network, and the Blue Jays – Canada’s only Major League Baseball team.  Rogers Sports &amp; Media is a subsidiary of Rogers Communications Inc. (TSX, NYSE: RCI). Visit <a href=\"https://www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/\">RogersSportsandMedia.com</a>.','AdsWizz Surpasses 1 Billion Monthly Podcast Downloads','','publish','open','open','','adswizz-surpasses-1-billion-monthly-podcast-downloads','','','2021-05-31 17:48:03','2021-05-31 17:48:03','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=839',0,'post','',0),(840,7,'2021-05-31 17:47:24','2021-05-31 17:47:24','Adwizz','GettyImages-692877006-scaled-2560x1280','Adwizz','inherit','open','closed','','gettyimages-692877006-scaled-2560x1280','','','2021-05-31 17:47:36','2021-05-31 17:47:36','',839,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/GettyImages-692877006-scaled-2560x1280-1.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(841,7,'2021-05-31 17:48:03','2021-05-31 17:48:03','<i>Innovative Publishing and Brand-Safe Sponsorship Solutions Empower Podcast Publishers to Meet Fast Growing Market Demand</i>\r\n\r\nPress Release from <a href=\"https://www.adswizz.com/1b-monthly-podcast-downloads\">AdsWizz</a>, a partner of Rogers Sports &amp; Media.\r\n\r\n<b>San Mateo, CA  April 16, 2021 — </b>AdsWizz, the global leader in digital audio and podcast technology solutions, has reached the milestone of over 1 billion monthly downloads from its audio platform. The platform, which is used by leading media companies and podcast publishers including NPR, The New York Times, NBCUniversal News Group, American Public Media, Stitcher, PodcastOne, WNYC Studios, and Rogers Sports &amp; Media in Canada, combines publishing tools and audience analytics from its Simplecast product with its award-winning suite of monetization products and services.\r\n\r\nThe company’s tech powers the four most-listened-to podcasts in the US: The Daily from The New York Times; NPR News Now from NPR; Up First from NPR; and Dateline NBC from NBCUniversal News Group. The platform also powers successful shows from Dax Shepard (Armchair Umbrella network), Kate Hudson (Sibling Revelry), and Anna Faris (Unqualified).\r\n\r\nAdsWizz offers a full suite of monetization options for enterprise podcasters. They can utilize AdsWizz campaign management platform, AdsWizz AudioServe for their direct sales teams;  they can place their podcasts into AdsWizz Podcast Marketplace (PodWave);  or they can tap into the power and breadth of the sales teams of Pandora, Stitcher, and others to monetize their podcasts.  SiriusXM acquired Stitcher and Simplecast last year.  AdsWizz is wholly owned by SiriusXM and operates independently;  Simplecast operations are now a part of AdsWizz.\r\n\r\nAdsWizz innovation includes the proprietary AdsWizz PodScribe Contextual Targeting Solution, introduced over two years ago, which delivers brand safety and brand suitability for podcast advertisers. AdsWizz meets the needs of today’s podcast publishers with industry standard capabilities including, dynamic host read ads, targeting by genre and show, and ad-free feeds for premium publishers. The platform also has advanced programmatic capabilities and allows for the automation of host read ads, enabling podcast publishers to grow and scale as the podcast industry explodes. AdsWizz innovation in digital audio and podcasting was recently recognized when it was awarded “Most Innovative Technology Platform” by Digiday in January of 2021.\r\n\r\n“Podcast publishers need solutions that meet the needs of today’s growing podcast market, as well as more sophisticated capabilities that can adjust to the changing complexities and growing demand of the future,” said Alexis van de Wyer, CEO of AdsWizz.  “We have made a strong commitment to help publishers stay one step ahead of the market, and provide innovative technology so they have one less thing to worry about.”\r\n\r\nSimplecast, which is now part of the AdsWizz podcast offering, is the premier stand-alone publishing and analytics solution for new and growing independent podcasters, and is expected to offer integrated monetization tools for those publishers later this year. Simplecast was recently rated as “<a href=\"https://www.sonics.io/best-podcast-hosting\">The Best Podcast Hosting Service</a>” by Sonics Podcasts in March of 2021.\r\n\r\n<b>About AdsWizz</b>\r\n\r\nAdsWizz has created the end-to-end technology platform that is powering the digital audio advertising and podcast ecosystem. AdsWizz is the underlying monetization solution for well-known music platforms, podcasts and broadcasting groups worldwide. Through dynamic ad insertion, advanced programmatic platforms, and innovative audio formats, AdsWizz efficiently connects buyers and sellers for digital audio and podcast advertising, and offers industry leading podcast publishing and analytics via Simplecast. AdsWizz is owned by SiriusXM, and is headquartered in San Mateo, California, with a Technology Development Hub in Bucharest, Romania.\r\n\r\n<strong>About Rogers Sports &amp; Media</strong>\r\nRogers Sports &amp; Media is a diverse sports and content company that connects with more than 30 million Canadians each week.  The company’s multimedia offerings include 54 radio stations, 29 local TV stations, 23 conventional and specialty television stations, podcasts, digital and e-commerce websites, and sporting events.  Rogers Sports &amp; Media delivers unique storytelling through its range of powerful brands: Citytv, OMNI Television, FX, TSC, 680 NEWS, 98.1 CHFI, KiSS, Breakfast Television, Cityline, CityNews, Sportsnet – Canada’s #1 sports network, and the Blue Jays – Canada’s only Major League Baseball team.  Rogers Sports &amp; Media is a subsidiary of Rogers Communications Inc. (TSX, NYSE: RCI). Visit <a href=\"https://www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/\">RogersSportsandMedia.com</a>.','AdsWizz Surpasses 1 Billion Monthly Podcast Downloads','','inherit','closed','closed','','839-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 17:48:03','2021-05-31 17:48:03','',839,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=841',0,'revision','',0),(842,7,'2021-05-31 18:32:43','2021-05-31 18:32:43','Multi-talented, Grammy® Award-winning artist Kelly Clarkson brings her singular voice and infectious enthusiasm to daytime television as the host of her own talk show. In each episode, the down-to-earth superstar delivers a funny, heartfelt and entertaining hour of celebrity guests, musical performances, fascinating stories, spontaneous surprises and so much more.','The Kelly Clarkson Show','','publish','closed','closed','','the-kelly-clarkson-show','','','2021-05-31 18:37:32','2021-05-31 18:37:32','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?post_type=rsm_show&#038;p=842',0,'rsm_show','',0),(843,7,'2021-05-31 18:32:19','2021-05-31 18:32:19','The kelly clarkson show','The kelly clarkson show','The kelly clarkson show','inherit','open','closed','','thumbnail','','','2021-05-31 18:32:37','2021-05-31 18:32:37','',842,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/thumbnail.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(844,7,'2021-05-31 18:32:43','2021-05-31 18:32:43','Multi-talented, Grammy® Award-winning artist Kelly Clarkson brings her singular voice and infectious enthusiasm to daytime television as the host of her own talk show. In each episode, the down-to-earth superstar delivers a funny, heartfelt and entertaining hour of celebrity guests, musical performances, fascinating stories, spontaneous surprises and so much more.','The Kelly Clarkson Show','','inherit','closed','closed','','842-revision-v1','','','2021-05-31 18:32:43','2021-05-31 18:32:43','',842,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/?p=844',0,'revision','',0),(845,7,'2021-05-31 18:34:19','2021-05-31 18:34:19','The kelly clarkson show','TKCS_Logo_010419-color','The kelly clarkson show','inherit','open','closed','','tkcs_logo_010419-color','','','2021-05-31 18:34:25','2021-05-31 18:34:25','',842,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/TKCS_Logo_010419-color.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(846,3,'2021-05-31 21:20:14','2021-05-31 21:20:14','What We Do - Advanced Advertising - R.E.D. Solutions','what-we-do-advanced-advertising','What We Do - Advanced Advertising - R.E.D. Solutions','inherit','open','closed','','what-we-do-advanced-advertising','','','2021-05-31 21:22:07','2021-05-31 21:22:07','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-advanced-advertising.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(847,3,'2021-05-31 21:20:17','2021-05-31 21:20:17','What We Do - Creative Solutions','what-we-do-creative-solutions','What We Do - Creative Solutions','inherit','open','closed','','what-we-do-creative-solutions','','','2021-05-31 21:21:50','2021-05-31 21:21:50','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(848,3,'2021-05-31 21:20:20','2021-05-31 21:20:20','What We Do - OOH','what-we-do-ooh','What We Do - OOH','inherit','open','closed','','what-we-do-ooh','','','2021-05-31 21:21:37','2021-05-31 21:21:37','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-ooh.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(849,3,'2021-05-31 21:20:23','2021-05-31 21:20:23','What We Do - Radio & Podcasts','what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts','What We Do - Radio & Podcasts','inherit','open','closed','','what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts','','','2021-05-31 21:21:26','2021-05-31 21:21:26','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(850,3,'2021-05-31 21:20:25','2021-05-31 21:20:25','What We Do - Sports','what-we-do-sports','What We Do - Sports','inherit','open','closed','','what-we-do-sports','','','2021-05-31 21:21:17','2021-05-31 21:21:17','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(851,3,'2021-05-31 21:20:28','2021-05-31 21:20:28','What We Do - Television & Streaming','what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming','What We Do - Television & Streaming','inherit','open','closed','','what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming','','','2021-05-31 21:21:09','2021-05-31 21:21:09','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(852,3,'2021-05-31 21:20:31','2021-05-31 21:20:31','What We Do - TSC','what-we-do-tsc','What We Do - TSC','inherit','open','closed','','what-we-do-tsc-3','','','2021-05-31 21:20:57','2021-05-31 21:20:57','',0,'https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(853,3,'2021-05-31 21:24:09','2021-05-31 21:24:09','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Our Products</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">SPORTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Home to Sportsnet, Canada\'s #1 sports media brand; the NHL, Toronto Blue Jays, Raptors, WWE, world class venues, productions and more. We believe that sport has the power to change the world and that we can all be United By Sport.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/sports\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Sports</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"850\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-sports.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Sports\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">TELEVISION & STREAMING</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Reaching 76% of total Canadian TV audience. We offer viewers a variety of intensely-local, urban-oriented and culturally diverse content across Canada. Hosting award-winning dramas and comedies, as well as working in partnership with the world’s largest ad-supported video on demand streaming service, Tubi.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/television-and-streaming/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Television & Streaming</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"851\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-televsion-and-streaming.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Television &amp; Streaming\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">RADIO & PODCASTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Rogers started with radio! Our founder, Ted Rogers purchased CHFI in 1960. We have grown to become a leading media company that strives to provide the best in news and entertainment to Canadians and Canadian businesses. Coast to coast, broadcasting from 55 Radio Stations and 29+ Podcasts, we create commercial campaigns that open the doors to new and returning customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/radio-podcasts/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Radio & Podcasts</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"849\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsan