-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-creative-solutions.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Creative Solutions\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/products-block -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-rsm-products-block row justify-content-between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">TODAY\'S SHOPPING CHOICE</h2><p class=\"product-description\">TSC is a leading interactive, multi-channel, Canadian retailer, offering a vast assortment of exclusive products and top brands to its customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\" https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/todays-shopping-choice/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore TSC</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"852\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-tsc-2-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/20