between flex-column-reverse flex-md-row\"><div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\"><h2 class=\"product-title\">RADIO & PODCASTS</h2><p class=\"product-description\">Rogers started with radio! Our founder, Ted Rogers purchased CHFI in 1960. We have grown to become a leading media company that strives to provide the best in news and entertainment to Canadians and Canadian businesses. Coast to coast, broadcasting from 55 Radio Stations and 29+ Podcasts, we create commercial campaigns that open the doors to new and returning customers.</p><div class=\"product-url\"><a href=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/what-we-do/radio-podcasts/\" class=\"product-url-link card-button\"><span class=\"product-url-text\">Explore Radio & Podcasts</span></a></div></div><div class=\"col-8 mx-auto mb-3 col-md-6 mb-md-auto mx-md-0 col-lg-4\"><img class=\"product-image\" data-id=\"849\" src=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720.jpg\" srcset=\"https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-475x720.jpg 475w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-198x300.jpg 198w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-768x1166.jpg 768w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-1012x1536.jpg 1012w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-320x485.jpg 320w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts-80x121.jpg 80w, https://preprod-www.rogerssportsandmedia.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/what-we-do-radio-and-podcasts.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 475px) 100vw, 475px\" alt=\"What We Do - Radio &amp; Podcasts\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:rsm/products-block -->\n\n<!-- wp:rsm/p